This repository is the Linux kernel (kernel/common android17-6.18 at 6.18.32)
with the arm64 UML port on top, plus the build and boot helpers under ci/,
docs/ and tools/. It is GPL-2.0-only, as is the kernel it is based on.

The arm64 UML port is by Oleksii Zakharov (github.com/zalexdev/linux-um-arm64).
